---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 py-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Static AI Hub</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Tools sederhana, tanpa backend, 100% Client-side.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      &copy; {year} Dibuat dengan <span class="text-red-500">♥</span> pakai Astro.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>